                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.76/15½: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Greece</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Goold</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-05-16T18:00:00-04:00">May 16, 1929—6
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>25. Your 36, May 15, 6 p.m. Department approves action taken by you.</p>
                <p>Please inform Minister of Communications through Foreign Office that Mr. Durham
                    left Paris for Athens on today’s Orient Express.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
